skeleton-extract-nothing = There are no bones laid bare: take the skin and muscles off first.
skeleton-extract-start = { CAPITALIZE($user) } is pulling the bones out of { $target }!
skeleton-extract-done = { CAPITALIZE($user) } pulls { $bones } out of the body.
skeleton-take-out = { CAPITALIZE($user) } takes { $bones } off { $from }.
skeleton-too-strong = { CAPITALIZE($bones) } is too strong to take apart by hand: it needs a saw or a crushing weapon.
skeleton-saw-start = { CAPITALIZE($user) } is sawing through { $bones }.
skeleton-saw-done = { CAPITALIZE($bones) } is sawn in two.
skeleton-cracked = { CAPITALIZE($bones) } cracks.
skeleton-broken-in-two = { CAPITALIZE($bones) } breaks in two!
skeleton-examine-broken = [color=red]The bones are broken.[/color]
skeleton-examine-take-apart = It can be taken apart with the middle mouse button.
skeleton-examine-saw = It can be sawn in two (middle mouse button with a saw in hand) or broken with a crushing weapon.

ui-options-function-eternal-war-take-apart = Take apart (bones)
